WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.470
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:14.380
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:21.130
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.830
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.930
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.300
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:43.230
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:49.480
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:56.750
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:03.490
What is truly precious?

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:12.980
Final Duel
Yugi vs Pegasus

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.230
Okay.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.070
I'm counting on you, my deck.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:31.250
Grandpa, it's finally time to battle Pegasus.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.810
I promise to win and get your soul back.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.080
Listen.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.780
Your true worth as a duelist is revealed when you are facing a crisis.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.150
Those who lose themselves will only walk on the path of defeat.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.260
Yugi, when you're in trouble, look to your own heart.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:57.310
You'll always find a way out.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.140
I understand, Grandpa.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.180
Yugi.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.050
Yugi, it's finally time.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:16.880
Everyone...

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.480
You made it this far, so you better win!

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.890
For Grandpa and Mokuba too.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.420
And for Kaiba.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.830
It's time.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.830
Challenger Yugi Muto, enter the Duel Ring.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:51.950
Here I come, Pegasus!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.840
Yugi, we're counting on you!

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.140
Do your best!

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.800
Show him your strength, Yugi!

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:24.350
It's time for the final battle.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:42.700
My cards, let's face the strongest duelist in the Kingdom together!

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:55.820
Yugi boy, you're a wonderful duelist.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:04:01.320
By winning your battles in the Kingdom, you earned the right to challenge me.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:07.260
Pegasus, you need to make a promise before this duel begins!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:10.860
If I win, you will release my grandpa's soul!

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.970
Yes, I promise.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:19.900
That's not all!  You'll also free Kaiba and Mokuba's souls from their cards!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.020
How strange.

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:25.340
Isn't Kaiba boy your enemy?

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:28.280
Right now, you're my only enemy.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.740
But...

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.900
But what should I do?

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:37.200
You don't need to steal.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.690
I promise to defeat Pegasus.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:48.570
I promised Mokuba that I would reunite him with his brother.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.300
I see.  A promise.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.340
Mind Scan?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.110
Okay, I promise.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:05.020
If you defeat me, I shall free them from their Soul Prisons.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.940
It's finally starting.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:11.020
Yeah!  I can almost see their fighting spirits clashing!

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.540
Yeah!  He finally made it here!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.940
I wonder if Yugi will be okay.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.600
The Millennium Eye lets Pegasus read his opponent's mind.  How can he beat that?

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.080
Whatever!  Yugi won't lose!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:29.670
He'll defeat Pegasus and become the true king of this kingdom!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:32.210
That's right!  Right, Honda?

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:37.880
I'm trying to get you fired up!  What are you thinking about, Honda?

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.720
Well, think about it.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.000
This isn't a fair fight.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.760
Yugi already has three hostages taken from him.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:53.100
But Pegasus only took Grandpa's soul hostage in order to get Yugi to participate in this duel.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:58.330
Pegasus is a duelist after all, so he won't play that dirty.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.420
Yeah.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.780
And your worrying won't change anything.

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.640
Their duel is about to start.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.700
Let's go to the terrace above so we can see more clearly.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.360
Yeah.  Let's go.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:16.220
Jonouchi and Anzu may feel that way, but you may be right, Honda.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.620
Pegasus is no pushover.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.480
If he gets in trouble during the duel, who knows what tricks he'll use.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.340
Honda, where are you going?

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:33.500
Even if I can't save Grandpa's soul, I may be able to save Mokuba and Kaiba so that Yugi has less to worry about.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.320
Mokuba...

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.320
Yugi Muto.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:46.680
Present Glory of the King's Opposite Hand to prove that you've qualified to challenge for Duelist Kingdom's throne.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:48.720
Here it is.

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:51.250
Glory of the King's Opposite Hand.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:52.800
Yes it is.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:07:02.560
With that card, if you defeat Duel Monsters creator and Duelist Kingdom king Pegasus J. Crawford...

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:09.180
...you have the right to receive Pegasus's 60% share of Industrial Illusions.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:15.210
In other words, you can become President of Industrial Illusions if you wish.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.880
Is he serious?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.820
Huh?  Where's Honda?

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:25.320
I don't know.  He left in the opposite direction alone.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.200
He probably went to the bathroom.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.290
Anyway, the duel is about to begin.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:34.530
It's a small present from me to you.

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:40.270
If someone has the skills to defeat me, then they deserve it.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:44.270
In other words, you're confident that no one can defeat you.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.570
Yes.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:51.680
But to get such spectacular glory, there are also risks.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.980
Look at Glory of the King's Opposite Hand.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:59.020
You'll notice that it has no picture.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.790
Do you know what that means, Yugi boy?

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:09.720
The picture on that card will appear when you lose.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:15.670
My soul will be sealed inside that card, just like Kaiba.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.410
Exactly.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:20.340
I'm prepared for that!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.780
Your courage is wonderful.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.520
Say what?

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.740
If Yugi loses, his fate will be the same as Kaiba?

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:33.720
Even knowing that, Yugi still challenged Pegasus?

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:36.460
He bet his own soul.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.720
His soul?

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.460
Is that possible?

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:44.570
I don't know.  But he can definitely end up like Kaiba and Mokuba.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.320
Yugi, don't lose.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.570
If you lose, I...

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.580
You must win, Yugi!

00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:02.020
Sorry Pegasus, but I have no intention of becoming a part of your card collection.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:08.090
I'm not planning to defeat you because I want another card.

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:13.600
My ultimate goal is to take control of Kaiba Corporation.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:21.200
The future of Kaiba Corporation rests on this duel.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.700
That's correct.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.140
If Mr. Pegasus defeats Yugi for us...

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:29.850
We'll sign a contract with him when he finds the key that Mokuba hid.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:35.920
Kaiba Corporation will be yours, Mr. Pegasus.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:41.420
Everything is ready.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:45.160
All that's left is to win this duel.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:51.600
Begin the match to determine the Duelist Kingdom champion.

00:09:56.810 --> 00:10:00.000
Cut and shuffle your opponent's cards.

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.690
Okay.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:24.570
Duel!

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:35.840
Yugi boy, as long as I have the power of the Millennium Eye, you cannot defeat me.

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.450
I won't lose.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.950
I can't afford to lose!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:15.460
I sounded confident with Bakura, but this castle is too big to search randomly.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.020
It's time to change shifts.

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:38.640
How is the kid?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.740
He's the same.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.140
He won't run away, but stay alert.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.400
Of course.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.720
He's the only one who knows where the key is hidden.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.120
Mokuba.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.850
What?  It's a dead end.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:09.880
How strange.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:22.150
What?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.360
What's this?

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.740
Here I go!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:39.930
It's my turn!

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:42.510
I set one card.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.210
I play this monster card in defense position.

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:56.620
Can his Millennium Eye really read my hand and my set cards?

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.200
It's my turn.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.460
I also set one card.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.000
And I'll play a monster card.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:17.120
I play Red Archery Girl in defense position.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.280
I end my turn.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:31.580
Red Archery Girl is a Water Attribute monster card.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.740
Did he play it faceup to invite me to attack?

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:41.300
Yugi boy, I know what you have.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:48.500
Your set cards are Beaver Warrior and Horn of the Unicorn.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:53.510
On the next turn, you'll use Beaver Warrior for a combo attack.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:58.580
Since his monster is Water Attribute, my set card will be more powerful.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:03.700
His set card concerns me, but I can't pass up this chance.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:06.400
Fine, I accept his invitation!

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.280
I switch my Beaver Warrior to attack position!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:17.600
And I activate my set card Horn of the Unicorn!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:27.010
Its sword gains electrical effects, raising its attack points by 700.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.280
Attack Red Archery Girl!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:32.180
You made a mistake.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.700
My trap card activates.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.570
I knew it!

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.590
Tears of a Mermaid.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.090
What?

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:54.100
Tears of a Mermaid is a trap card that activates when your set card is flipped faceup.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:57.670
It stops all your attacks.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:05.010
Beaver Warrior is hit by its own electricity, lowering its attack points to their original value.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.980
It's my turn.

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:11.120
I switch Red Archery Girl to attack position.

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.780
Arrow Shot!

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:20.020
Beaver Warrior is destroyed.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:25.560
It's like he knew what cards Yugi would play.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:28.840
It must be Pegasus's Mind Scan.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.640
What's up with Honda?

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.140
He still isn't here.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.140
You're right.  It's been awhile.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:41.180
Sheesh, what's he doing at a time like this?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:47.190
Pegasus's Millennium Eye is really allowing him to read my hand.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.390
That is correct, Yugi boy.

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:55.400
Pegasus is the creator of these cards and the undefeated king.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:59.400
How can I fight the power of his Millennium Eye?

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:03.860
You wasted a turn, Yugi boy.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:08.620
Every turn's card choice and attack timing are important in this game.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:14.480
One mistake after another add up to a player's defeat.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:19.150
But let me tell you one thing: I don't make mistakes.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.680
Pegasus has complete confidence in his game.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:27.730
If I can't stop him from intimidating me, I can't win.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:29.920
That punk Pegasus!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.680
People make mistakes!

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.860
Does he think that he's a god?

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:39.970
Pegasus created Duel Monsters, so he's like a god.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:43.310
The creator rules that world.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:47.520
Bakura, are you saying that Yugi can't win?

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:48.880
I'm not saying that.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.690
But I don't know if he can defeat Pegasus.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.920
I believe in Yugi!

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:11.700
Croquet is too worried.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:16.000
Even if a guard wasn't here, that kid can't go anywhere.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.080
Are you sure about that?

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.110
Of course.

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:30.820
That was easy.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.520
Mokuba?

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:58.020
I set one monster in defense position and end my turn.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:06.060
I'm here.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.290
This is the central control room.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.720
An underground prison in Area B-1 has been unlocked.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:15.840
We believe someone may have entered.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.140
How would Pegasus like us to deal with the intruder?

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.140
Pegasus is currently dueling.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.000
Understood.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.380
You have my permission.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.600
Take care of it.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:32.640
Understood.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.520
Yugi, be careful!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:37.520
Don't lose your cool, Yugi!

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:45.000
This is bad.  They're on to me.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.300
It's my turn.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:59.980
I set one card and play Ryu-Ran in defense position.

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:11.780
Then I switch Red Archery Girl to defense position and end my turn.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.800
I can't go this way either.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.010
What should I do?

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.140
It's my turn.

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:40.700
Yugi boy is like a tiny animal pathetically squirming in the palm of my hand.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:45.060
I know your hand as if it was my own.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:46.960
Mind Scan!

00:19:55.660 --> 00:20:01.010
Is Summoned Skull the card that you just drew?

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.240
He looks at me as if he can see my cards.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:07.680
What I'm feeling is not my imagination!

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.840
We're counting on you, Yugi!

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:12.820
Yugi!

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:20.160
He's reading my mind, but I can't do anything about it.

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:36.510
Pegasus is reading Yugi's strategies!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:40.880
Pegasus plays Toon World, which he used to defeat Kaiba.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.600
Yugi's attacks don't work against Toons!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:47.760
Even Summoned Skull is turned into a Toon that attacks Yugi!

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:53.520
Bakura left to find Honda, but what's going to happen in this duel?

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:57.600
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Impossible to Defeat!?
The Invincible Toon Army

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.280
Duel, standby!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:12.220
The flask glistens

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:20.070
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:29.040
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:36.820
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:42.650
Shower of happiness

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:46.760
I will shower you with it

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:55.040
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:59.270
Shower of happiness

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:03.400
You are not alone

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:10.120
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
